   "answer": "On the FM-310, error E-17 means an empty pipe has been detected; the recommended action is to ensure the pipe is full at the sensor and check the installation position [1].\n\nNote: E-17 has a different meaning on the PX-200 Pressure Transmitter, where it indicates a sensor diaphragm fault [3], but that does not apply to the FM-310.",
