   "answer": "For a PX-200 in steam service, verify the zero point annually and perform a span calibration every three years [1]. Note that clean, dry gas service does not require periodic recalibration, but this exemption does not apply to steam service [1]. All adjustments should be recorded in the maintenance log [1].",
